{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 929,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d08dc5c50a74eb60a8d5c223",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "第三弯道位于领头时,速度少量提升\\n并回复少量体力,若是东京竞马场\\n中距离比赛则增加技能持续时间",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d6725ada09a32804d6eee9a844988ab93df387d489918e5d5dd6e64abe6a444",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4fd6e351a04a2ea4dd44952",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段左右处在中间集团\\n速度提升,若是中距离比赛,且至此为止\\n发动过7次技能,则速度会大幅提高",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3eb42e7169b9d141cfd8312e6000de4dff610b3a192f302b08db9b28d15ecbb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f96ba4742494bf793f3e2ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后半部分位于队伍中间时\\n速度持续少量提升,且在长距离比赛\\n低人气的情况下,速度持续大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "c87c057bc2d343821a6776f99cfcfebe8f8d412c54a00be16d7c2528f982aad4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d237391c07fcd0904608ccd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于领头时\\n速度少量提升,并根据进入终盘前\\n取得的领先距离提供额外速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "19caeb4eeb15646eaad2cb96123f97e4869a76f5422be75a0ee4fea7625189ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ac1fa614c20655d678a68e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段位于后方时速度提升\\n之后在终盘的最终弯道处\\n准备超越时\\n短时间内稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "3575e0a6225b015c6943337b6efd8e0fe95905e4d0029761cf0c67fd44f77b45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bff239de9af90a808d7e6ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛前半段的弯道若位于队伍中间\\n则少量提升速度,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则变为少量持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a59cbc24a6c830446e9946d819cff3c1c3c9ea4c6b16890026e8ed52d6521df2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76ae0393de58ee15c3fb3b7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余800m自身位于队伍中间\\n则短时间内小幅向前突进并略微提升加速度\\n若是根干距离的比赛且自身位于后方\\n则额外提供微量的加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "aadd28db393aaf940700148a3e44cb9c4f229b5e2d0e659fb725704dbaec4f3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a637b96ae021180161977c64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时,速度大幅提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f98a597a24bd90cd97b6102a0150b1b58dac908f579a469896e93e1290bc96b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d575ec15233d1e38f9c1ae9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时若位于中团以后位置\\n加速度提升,视野稍微变得宽广\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d5c9dac5a979cb3ae2d0150c2ce0a9e7c149c7bf521bbf6b6221ebb18d3c142",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30f4dddd251d9ed5464cfb97",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4d347c2609ea0af037acaddda38b4346cf4f067b45c5ad28e2a6633fc673ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101102111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9c761eabe479e077d76eaa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若位于中团以后的位置\\n则回复持久力并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d39ed86fb15ae53852e08a134457bdf903a4822123a0b4dfa2ec2ff063ff0f76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101102211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27475e8ce2ed4daa8e7fdb7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的直线消耗耐力\\n使速度极大提升,若是中山赛场的\\n长距离比赛,则不消耗耐力\\n并提升技能效果＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e812906fcb58339006fd25ada2982a96effad012b540e94ebba4db1870ed32c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101103111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc004626c907980270da3214",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道及往后时\\n若对手赛马娘发动速度技能\\n则一段时间内向前突进＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "84b8ec538867ab3afa09fac450ec9a682112b4dd5148a9dd28758e0e742a7f0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101103211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26181c84eaab3d269a81b0c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上从后方赶超时\\n会使用末脚少量加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "230107a6aeccc06355d46bd2993bdd0c23685f1cb2c199c16370cfb66bbc661d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbabd5e6c5b221037ab539d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段附近位于队伍中间时\\n少量持续性提升速度,若当前位于上坡则提高效果量",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8008cdc71d99ce1a2c2b4735b186490a209b1bcef00cfa57163c8ea78cc8e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:637a3185042cc4adef235d7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当进入比赛最终冲刺阶段时\\n速度在短时间内小幅提升\\n在英里赛中发动技能时，若处于前方\\n效果会发生改变，在短时间内大幅冲向前方",
      "source_fingerprint": "21fe24c7a9a0728cd5d2c9a06786ccc350ab850ecd91eebe4c8bcbdb8f44658d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:191e50a0928e77ce61ccfbde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段的弯道若位于好位置\\n则速度提升,若是2200m的比赛\\n则速度持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5cd685925345e8e8d1d2aef88d2da73562c7921e3c84eb24aede3586f9cacb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a1e6f653d206fe4325edfc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中间点位于队伍中部或更后方时\n略微向前突进\n若是英里或中距离比赛\n则大幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "24ad6fa032d429a00c0d63cd2d63ce414503d70818b17f735b4e6b390d7202fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f66ecbac7da1aec86bdb0230",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在距离终点还有1000米时会持续稍微领先\\n如果是在中距离或长距离比赛且所有\\n基础能力都足够高\\n则会持续领先＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bad211d4bf084b394db87255239ad34143bd29cf7340862b91058813285331c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa4e47dd05868fa53be131a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛前半段的弯道位于前方时\\n速度少量提升,之后在终盘的最终直线\\n位于队伍前方,则短时间内速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "ede476711147a73de9d0cfa6d8e9c017c5c5bb41f46a5d9dd46c811a2346fe02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f66788e919296ff2f015808",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛中盘以及往后完成超越\\n进入终盘的最终直线时短时间内速度提升\\n若作战为追赶且比赛中盘以及往后完成3次及以上超越\\n则变为短时间内速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4edbdfbaa0f3b895e8b42995a3797b934b2aebe57c230a1fd4cc62a2d7fc799",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfb41e6436ab3b5cf73108ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近速度略微提升\\n在草地中距离比赛中\\n若技能发动时处于队伍中列或之后\\n则较长时间持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d65c507ac6ea6a36d8adb22632ecd3f5222ee39246a8412e11a97764ab90479d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b355fa6044f7734aead96e16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冲进终盘时位于后方且距离终点尚远\\n则短时间内向前小幅突进\\n如果是中山竞马场或阪神竞马场的中长距离比赛\\n则之后在直线上短时间内迅速向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba7dec2700e8db7f993b22c4c930f728c55de38f9d70f0372105845a4715a199",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62e98d7862a1dde62578e56a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "第4浪时若位于前方则短时间\\n速度提升,如果发动过「无二」「无三」\\n则改变效果量,短时间速度超幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b00ec977f7032657e9344a1c4fc36af0e8f3339b996780bb75596dadb297d70",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998786e44cb88f2c1e3510f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道以后被超越时\\n大幅提升速度\\n并且微幅提升提升加速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d97d0402d5517fa96ec8bc74d843bb162081bdcd90444bdc85ac2c539fd7ddd8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:004c8f55e391784d54f1107e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道以后赶超后\\n在最后200米处速度大幅提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee12bfdfe4b7fb0c5208d922a398c00486268f6fc1477d58ed73667f95f7b75a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101201121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7343bc620a8cedacf10910bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处后方\\n则在最后冲刺阶段的关键时刻\\n大幅提升加速度\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "195ea9eb140b366a583be1ee46058fe7d5eae41b0630c4d03713024d4b6f2e05",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f1f1950a3699b428e3a435",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "eed551748df9cc8c25b5414065b97f7cddcf0f58810ce3a38531d5ed543a1253",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d2a2174aa828682a08732e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冲进终盘之前一直保持冷静的话\\n会在终盘一开始的一段时间内\\n提升加速度＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d961137cddf08681b7dc2124842e35cc3a413b5d5e2021a4945ad8df7dcf87f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9c1b73be5657fd78396e45f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘初期加速度提升\\n并小幅向前突进＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "faddb079d716fb406f80c66c28271d18414a9c57f33ca40c6fd2c34a596a56ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101202221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a7b18c57b52aef4ec6f9b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道完成赶超后\\n在最终冲刺时速度提升\\n若在短距离和英里比赛发动技能时\\n自身位于队伍中间,则变为速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f13ff3944063a7ecd06bebe009d5043d1d9f1d1cb0040e78b5a18a1d4fc0f02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7852a1e794aa6e983283c06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处若位于前方则少量提升速度\\n若是在1600m～2000m的比赛发动该技能\\n且此时位于领头或者距离领头4马身以内\\n则大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1546c94e6cdc3deb5ce045106715d4ba0c0be2853da1296cc609bd97e2c950",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17c261ec93bc774dd08ddbd7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半的直道处于中团时,速度会\\n提升,如果是长距离比赛则效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "735966de10feed0d3aebd4b76fbafb779f5710cdee3e2fc994868d9a844d52df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0fbe2db12716b1b1ee3f158",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中盘弯道位于前方时，短时间内大幅向前突进；\n若为中距离，则短时间内以极大幅度向前突进。\n之后在全力冲刺期间，若处于前3名\n则在某处短时间内展现出强劲的后劲＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb167a6ceff52cc22ec8dcf3c594a9db5e16258ddd54a2710f41f24523c4afd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c6c350052af11577ff29a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在剩余1000m处若身处前方\\n速度稍微提升，若在草地英里或中距离\\n比赛中发动技能且当时身处直线\\n则效果改变为持续向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "358910997dc6485ca00d3f3b42a0858b45309545a3cbd9a5f65ebeaa3a052d4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8086d2e53d881fcaaa7ce48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n速度大幅提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "53e5facb582f28ffaec9e57415552a72d35d693a619f0202029c6ee5ff81f1ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9340eb6ae5cb623799d2ec00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则回复持久力并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "876d5c78bd417366fd80f6e877d8511ccd89a27bf9dc06f1e37ffeb276f69604",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f7a39fe3fb886f20ba26119",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时回复持久力\\n并稍微提升速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "54b629ff3bf9a091a092da93367762a285a481370575d43162d70888b5f84e1c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101302111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46da68ab7c7cdf7b85f8228",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处直线时,大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "60d117f0ce7aa178e16ab80eddaf45018f77a8c4f8f6ba4738142f98904b7f44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101302211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a4f08d0a8e1d8484d9b0eb4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n一段时间内速度持续提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab48fbc140e0de7f07c0c0e85e3d37a606c07a667320a1f6ef01ff0b2ca550ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101303111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0904b5b6d84d16c38e7baa6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是出闸时没有起步晚\\n则在中盘开始时极大幅回复持久力\\n＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db57e7473d06927b4bd8882ef704254a50ac6aeb6bcd4c089cb5e066c3f716c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101303211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32152faf442523e887cf688b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中途如果处于中团或更后的位置\\n会短时间冲到前方,短距离或英里\\n比赛的话,随后在最后冲刺阶段\\n会短时间大幅领先",
      "source_fingerprint": "41665c3f60c86cea0c164163c5b006226759f08689cecc6ac69d7f08073dee62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b6c09c864a3c721a99c34a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛接近尾声时,速度会稍微提升\\n如果是中距离比赛\\n效果会根据从粉丝那里收到的爱意\\n最多提升至3倍＜居中・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "175d8f90ae43a9da388813bbe1674a2ae52965a5e8389d8a34f07e005ed22d80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f388bda855f8bf935094c47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近短时间内少量提升速度\\n若是中长距离比赛,则该技能\\n与进化后觉醒技能的\\n持续时间变为2倍＜先行・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb4b99caceac69717e9a6a03179c78f9346dbd4ad39f17d6278d870f45f31dbc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8306a9df6ad53cef0d0c4d03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n若附近有2名以上的赛马娘\\n则持续稍微提升速度\\n若是英里或中距离比赛则效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc5d7cf0a4597734608e530c7a074347e389cbf1cf459a154ef170cd96987dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79341f12d782b89ef3741332",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段持续略微提升速度\n若是2000m以上的比赛，之后\n会在最后冲刺阶段短暂\n略微提升加速度<居中/后追>",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8d6924bfeb1e2ae3174c176b819dc356545f0804375c4da18fbb3f88f52c82d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af7d9be1a5c76650264a559",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘位于中团及以后且余力充足时向前突进\\n若已发动「圣女的试炼」提升速度\\n则随后在全速冲刺阶段的某处短时间内\\n稍微领先＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6121930582effa560c1214d3ce999980f3cc5efcbb15e2c0727282d36991d37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b8ed33d6c6983ca60a4ff83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘初期位于中团及以前时长时间持续稍微\n向前突进，若「大逃」已发动\n则效果改变，稍微回复持久力且\n速度略微提升<中距离/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dd543a68dd6c7c1fb87cc4b4136741f2376d3b4722891bbf82fe20cdf01ccc9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91ee747dff241d80a3ed6594",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘时视野变得广阔\\n并且稍微提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac3acbb16e72c1651209543b56558fb899a57839bc95999f8d6ad04a87829dd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03fcdb78fab7598e0e160751",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则回复持久力并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "876d5c78bd417366fd80f6e877d8511ccd89a27bf9dc06f1e37ffeb276f69604",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa5dcc28b146c40c093a966",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处后方\\n则超越他人的能力大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ecbcd1e6772e5071bdc904678313839b345b1bff7df65edd26085fb69eec604",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101402111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb49ed208b1e9f0e9be5690",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘一段时间内向前突进\\n＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "832fc0d118868c0a611d7c0be82bbc5608763d5f4e43ce946f326d18b86eca32",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101402121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf7ef25f6c6ebe1ce78d7da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道外侧完成超越时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac283942a6196d951b1d132d6b9bce85c31f22d7559039d06263bcb706f0912",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101402211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41f6b66fda14cac1a1445953",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上仍保有余力且处于前列时\\n更容易保持优势",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea70da9300d31994bc9b7c502a619d078ec678062580c5abf87e7c723dad26ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c4c3611da96cace02b3950d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段一段时间内少量提升速度\\n若是2000m以上的比赛,则在此之后\\n于最后冲刺阶段短暂地\\n稍微提升加速度＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "234038c373a0e51f19d8a2608c808fb366d07d407d23f694337e3a87214e0fe5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13796841a97ee7efe8a8e602",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入中盘时若身处后方,在临近终盘时\\n向前突进,若是中距离比赛,之后\\n进入最终直线时若身处前方,则\\n微幅向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd3e5792555def68f28f11198d7a2751297f02757d292adb459b6a9f7749e3dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c8b785413327dc6a6f58f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑顺利的话\\n长时间持续稍微向前突进,或者\\n起跑较晚且在中间地点处于后方时\\n速度大幅提升＜先行/追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "34e9b51fa293949429abdfd46ffdb6269a411c7a55aab85deaf92500ffd33f58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbb4068ab3e62aa6c17fc01e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道时若身处前方\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a17ff703477351c015b7ff8d61dbc9b485c5744c28acc899e81c3eec3af755b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4186b50752eac30a0ef51ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ab865343e8d2cc7bb11ba21bb5f4c18a8900cd98590b35dbb75747988f7955f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0660adf243386eedbebd6597",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在弯道上大幅回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "c92ced88d53eaa547ee0cddd763b21c4bd9772c4fe4ba06bbe863ecf847cd694",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101502111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3346b0771f55fb774b3c7031",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于弯道时\\n稍微回复体力\\n并提升速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "853dcc49b1a9f292cc4de8d097cf62403bd274c3486811bcac5dc0a9019520ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101502121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeda960de425d2119a35acd2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n则速度大幅提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e71b347d91dc73a3728e7be6c5796c02dc0489e4fbe9bed5ce98722954e6e68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101502211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e61b62c395dae1158f7146d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处直线时,速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "acf6ea7af15af18820e9cef0faf404ae34ecaf125ffde3d8ab7767a8d0f11524",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3516299e263c45173105ae2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的关键时刻\\n速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "303365d3b9bca3d0c503f27ffae41e2365e2ebca7d3d25a6a21fadd2352b84c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eb593ef03e6c43c968c5c0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半阶段完成超越时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7577053a5f39c7b93e3abf9810b2e83f17ede43f4d37453b6a07910e76f5c47",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101602111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9283b090208e4840ffdbf69a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若处于领先或是\\n距离领先赛马娘四马身以内的话\\n加速度大幅提升＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b155fabf6419ce44215445bf11a9ecd88e9b28249cd67399e21145234c9e0371",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101602211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d0248934ac75ebc64853cdb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时,向前大幅突进\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87267eb19e2bb34ee1e8dd929c025e0cfa57407de55eb4cddd0469bdf459d54",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b9fd0a4a89a6dc73d9c1bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘试图超越时\n向前突进且加速度稍微提升<长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6de530b996e11251fe6f1353cdbcf03a8975a70f311040dced84c85346bf42e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101701121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4591c460c5c5ae49fcab47f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "变得更擅长过弯\\n一段时间内速度持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08cdac0f31f30de40df3a4fd4b8e3eae7634111cb9807789919f676b69e1de1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f0d31ff28ceb6d44f4ee67a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则大幅回复持久力＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d75d85e1652e3afea83429d16b4b0016132d2aa32eeddfeeb7a96d5aba7e73bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101702111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4fa750ae58aecc0380fb451",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "变得更擅长秋季的比赛\\n速度与力量大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd3214a1d472f5e4b026e514c9eee30412c9a1ee30b2401a0cfb1b5146a0654b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101702211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37508bc803e2055fd6abe2e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "716cdf4f2cbda393a3094d346a2ccaa0ad5c082d248021dde457f4c7549350ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101801111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:781b84792cc80abcee971d78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时路线选择更加明智\\n并且稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "206f75b9cc0fffb2196b8e9a1c1767dd48cac4a561e7a8e49fc3db481a7dea44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101801211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ad130d5aaace5808cdc2c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行赶超时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ca05cc81c73b790a685e3cb7060a8f950366484d517baf8f9a8b7b3e27c946d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101802111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc10e151fbf3d3dc5feaf3d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在弯道上加速度提升\\n并且稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "4891d8615127e57d568f37b1dfedb6f36e9bc5bb3a2e3e323bef8491f2b122fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101802211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6eebe3660eb7d4851aa447a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道加速度略微提升\n若是草地比赛则额外略微向前突进<英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "f61ac5058aac35dacfcd99dec1fcc00e7d4ed6cd32127734cdc8bb4f8a520e44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101802221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b88c1e7a061b4d9099cd02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道从中后方赶超时\\n犹如女帝般的奔跑会使速度少量加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "97dc1e6b8b961450922129c006b286818850e29716a5e989bc0e68ad15d398cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5f1f8ea9ae1105bdb54787d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是身边存在大量赛马娘的话\\n速度提升\\n并且稍微回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bec227a8c3cf55650eae55aacd67367648d89dbf769d10b321ef3cbc4f4d54b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a3b89a2e5d4317e9fb4ae99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时\\n一段时间内路线的选择变得更明智\\n并且小幅提升加速度＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "680232d6fff9ef57e5f263ee1152086d0533c9f368b67ebe634582300a871505",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101901211"
      ]
    },
    {
